# Frontend build-time variables for pages/public (Vite).
#
# Copy to `.env.development` for local work. In production these are set as
# Cloudflare Pages build environment variables. Both `.env*` files are
# gitignored; this example is the committed, placeholder-only reference.
#
# IMPORTANT: Vite inlines every `VITE_*` value into the client bundle at build
# time. Nothing here is secret — anyone can read these values out of the shipped
# JavaScript. Only put values here that are safe to publish, and restrict any
# API key by origin at the provider rather than relying on it being hidden.

# Solana RPC endpoint for the wallet-adapter connection, used by every
# wallet-connected tool (dc-mint, multi-gateway, update-location, iot-onboard,
# mobile-onboard) via src/multi-gateway/SolanaProvider.jsx.
#
# Unset falls back to the public RPC (https://api.mainnet-beta.solana.com) with
# a console warning. That keeps the tools loading, but the public endpoint is
# aggressively rate limited, so set this to a real endpoint for anything beyond
# a quick look. A staked provider URL usually embeds an API key: that key ships
# in the bundle, so lock it to the site's origin in the provider's dashboard.
VITE_SOLANA_URL="https://your-provider.example/?api-key=REPLACE_ME"
